  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdded helpers and 8 named layout tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout_windows.rs`:\n\n- `layout_window_post_refusal`: Post refused window.\n- `layout_window_unsaved_prompt`: Unsaved changes modal and Cancel button.\n- `layout_window_fixture_library`: Save fixture and Insert from library modals.\n- `layout_window_fixture_vise`: Add built-in vise modal.\n- `layout_window_fixture_plate`: Add fixture plate modal.\n- `layout_window_fixture_accessory`: Add accessory modal.\n- `layout_window_machines`: Machines pane and its anchors.\n- `layout_window_gcode`: G-code program window.\n\nThe tests check frame containment on screen. They check anchor containment and order inside each frame. Modal tests also check the dismiss button.\nThe module has a provenance comment. The test module list includes the new module. `page_layout.rs` does not change against main.\nThe decision record is in `docs/decisions/1991-window-layout-tests.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe remaining floating windows, fixture modals, unsaved prompt, and Machines pane needed named layout tests.\nThis PR adds test coverage. It changes no product code or rendered UI.\n\n## Tests\n\n- All 8 named layout tests passed.\n- Temporary text pins failed with the missing provenance comment and the old PR body. The corrected text passed both pins.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed; 9 steps, 0 failed.\n- UI library: 1061 passed, 0 failed, 6 release snapshot tests ignored.\n- Integration suites: boundary 3; boundary_picks 7; sinker_setup 2; tap_hand 3; theme_example 3; theme_files 15; waterjet_tool 1. All passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nOther workspace suites and the 6 ignored release snapshot tests were not run.\nBefore/after screenshots do not apply because this PR changes no rendered UI.\n\nChangelog: none\nFixes #1991\n",
